 retail spaces.</p>\n<p data-start=\"428\" data-end=\"770\">Built with advanced LED technology, the collection ensures bright, flicker-free lighting while significantly reducing energy consumption and maintenance costs. The precision-designed optics provide wide beam distribution for maximum coverage, while the efficient heat-dissipation housing extends product lifespan even in demanding conditions.</p>\n<p data-start=\"772\" data-end=\"1040\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">With durable materials, stable performance, and easy installation, the UFO High Bay Light collection offers a reliable lighting solution for both new projects and energy-efficient retrofits\u2014delivering performance, efficiency, and long-term value in one compact design.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start\">\n<p>\u00a0</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0333/6745/7925/files/des_icon_img.png\"></p>\n<h2>Applications</h2>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"list-style-type: square;\">Office</li>\n<li style=\"list-style-type: square;\">Malls</li>\n<li style=\"list-style-type: square;\">Warehouse</li>\n<li style=\"list-style-type: square;\">Commercial Area</li>\n<li style=\"list-style-type: square;\">Shops</li>\n<li style=\"list-style-type: square;\">Other General Use</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</article>", "published_at": "2026-01-27T16:56:50+05:00", "created_at": "2026-01-27T16:56:48+05:00", "updated_at": "2026-07-17T22:39:34+05:00", "vendor": "ORIENT Lighting", "product_type": "Street Light", "tags": ["3000K", "6500K", "DAY LIGHT", "ORIENT", "WARM LIGHT"], "variants": [{"id": 41503994183813, "title": "100 Watt / 6500k", "option1": "100 Watt", "option2": "6500k", "option3": null, "sku": "500000000444", "requires_shipping": true, "taxable": true, "featured_image": {"id": 34707921043589, "product_id": 7238401261701, "position": 1, "created_at": "2026-01-27T16:51:57+05:00", "updated_at": "2026-01-27T16:51:59+05:00", "alt": 